Organizations and for-profit entities wishing to use, deploy, integrate, or commercialize ThesisOut or its 7-agent verification pipeline (`harvester-agent`, `pdf-extractor-agent`, `data-cleansing-agent`, `ml-rigor-scientist`, `deep-inference-auditor`, `translation-whitespace-agent`, `qa-production-guardian`) may purchase a Commercial License under the following standard pricing schedule:

1. Tier 0 — Personal, Academic, Non-Profit & University Tech-Transfer Evaluation
   - Price: FREE ($0 / year)
   - Scope: Unlimited use for personal projects, academic research, doctoral dissertation benchmarking, classroom instruction, and non-profit scientific research with attribution.

2. Tier 1 — Seed Startups, Boutique IP Funds & Independent Consultants (<= 10 employees)
   - Price: $4,800 USD / year (or $450 USD / month, up to 3 seats)
   - Scope: Internal commercial use for scouting academic assets, auditing uploaded datasets/PDFs across the 30-model + 5-stage conformal pipeline, and generating provisional patent claims and venture dossiers.

3. Tier 2 — Venture Capital, Biotech/MedTech R&D & Corporate BD Teams
   - Price: $18,000 USD / year (up to 15 seats; single VPC / Cloud Run deployment)
   - Scope: Full commercial deployment within a venture fund, mid-market biotech/pharma R&D group, or corporate business development team, including custom dataset/PDF ingestion, 9-API clinical/patent whitespace auditing, and priority updates.

4. Tier 3 — Enterprise Pharma, Global R&D & OEM / White-Label Source License
   - Price: $48,000 USD / year (Unlimited seats, multi-region VPC deployment) or $125,000 USD one-time perpetual buyout
   - Scope: Worldwide enterprise-wide commercial license, full source-code modification rights without attribution requirements, custom internal registry connectors, and OEM/embedded integration rights.

